In addition to his role on The Office, Zach is well-known for his roles on such shows as Veep, The Good Wife, and Silicon Valley.
除了在《办公室》中的角色外，扎克还因出演《副总统》、《傲骨贤妻》和《硅谷》等剧集而闻名。

