00:29:42.060 --> 00:29:51.280
My favorite part of this beat was watching Rain as Dwight try to figure out where to set the hot dogs down, and there was no place to set them down.
这段情节里我最喜欢的部分是看雷恩饰演的德怀特试图找出把热狗放在哪里，结果根本没地方放。

