下面是文章的内容。

717
00:30:42.940 --> 00:30:56.020
For an old-school hot dog experience in Scranton, look no further than Coney Island Lunch, where it's all about Texas wieners, which are a bit different than your standard hot dog.
要在斯克兰顿体验老派热狗风味，找“康尼岛午餐”就对了，那里的主打是德克萨斯维纳热狗，它跟标准热狗有点不同。

718
00:30:56.020 --> 00:31:09.620
Using a 93-year-old recipe, Coney Island Lunch makes its hot dogs with a Burke's all-beef wiener on a national bakery roll, topped with Dusseldorf mustard, fresh diced onions,
“康尼岛午餐”采用93年历史的配方，用伯克的纯牛肉肠配上国民面包店的面包卷，浇上杜塞尔多夫芥末酱和新鲜的洋葱丁，

719
00:31:09.860 --> 00:31:14.960
and its famous chili sauce, which is also available for sale by the pint or quart.
以及他们著名的辣椒酱，这种酱也可以按品脱或夸脱购买。

720
00:31:14.960 --> 00:31:21.500
Though not quite traditional, you can also top yours with cheddar cheese sauce, sweet relish, and sauerkraut.
虽然不太传统，但你也可以在上面加切达干酪酱、甜酸黄瓜碎和德国酸菜。

721
00:31:22.060 --> 00:31:29.040
Beloved in the region, this lunch counter's Texas wiener was named third best in the USA.
这家深受当地人喜爱的快餐柜台的德克萨斯维纳热狗被评为全美第三名。

722
00:31:29.380 --> 00:31:29.880
Wow.
哇。

723
00:31:29.880 --> 00:31:36.860
By Fox News, and it was also ranked on the Daily Meals list of the 35 best hot dogs in America.
由福克斯新闻评选的，它还在《每日餐食》评选的美国35大最好热狗榜单上名列前茅。

724
00:31:37.120 --> 00:31:41.460
So I guess Scranton is making the dogs.
所以我想斯克兰顿确实在做热狗。

725
00:31:41.700 --> 00:31:42.840
So this was true.
所以这是真的。

726
00:31:43.100 --> 00:31:43.460
True.
真的。

727
00:31:44.200 --> 00:31:48.580
As everyone's applauding for Gabe, Gabe applauds right back and says, and to you.
当大家为盖比鼓掌时，盖比也回以掌声并说：“也谢谢你们。”

728
00:31:49.280 --> 00:31:49.760
Amazing.
太棒了。

729
00:31:50.040 --> 00:31:50.940
Amazing moment.
精彩的时刻。

730
00:31:51.500 --> 00:31:54.380
And Michael says, you know, we're so excited to meet you.
迈克尔说：“你知道的，我们很高兴见到你。”

731
00:31:54.520 --> 00:31:56.160
We've even prepared a song for you.
“我们甚至为你准备了一首歌。”

732
00:31:56.520 --> 00:31:57.000
Yes.
没错。

733
00:31:57.180 --> 00:32:01.520
To which Gabe says, oh, I'm going to record it and put it on the Saber website.
对此盖比说：“哦，我要把它录下来放到雪芭官网上。”

734
00:32:01.780 --> 00:32:04.860
And immediately Michael looks at everyone and goes, Saber.
迈克尔立刻看着大家说：“雪芭。”

735
00:32:05.560 --> 00:32:06.040
Saber.
“雪芭。”

736
00:32:06.140 --> 00:32:08.140
And everyone's like, oh, Saber.
每个人都说：“哦，雪芭。”

737
00:32:08.620 --> 00:32:09.000
Saber.
“雪芭。”

738
00:32:09.000 --> 00:32:09.080
Saber.
“雪芭。”

739
00:32:09.080 --> 00:32:17.120
Well, it's not going to be enough time for Andy and Aaron to adjust their song that they've planned.
好吧，安迪和亚伦根本没有足够的时间来调整他们计划好的歌曲。

740
00:32:17.920 --> 00:32:20.300
It is amazing, this song.
这首歌太棒了。

741
00:32:20.500 --> 00:32:25.280
It is a song parody to the tune of Party in the USA by Miley Cyrus.
它是改编自麦莉·赛勒斯的歌曲《美国派对》的恶搞歌曲。

742
00:32:25.620 --> 00:32:27.280
I thought we should listen to it.
我觉得我们应该听听。

743
00:32:33.340 --> 00:32:37.440
Hopped off the train in Scranton, PA, another cloudy gray afternoon.
走下斯克兰顿、宾夕法尼亚州的火车，又是一个多云阴沉的下午。

744
00:32:38.440 --> 00:32:41.240
Jumped in the cab here you are for the first time.
跳上出租车，你第一次来到这里。

745
00:32:41.360 --> 00:32:43.580
Look to the right and you see the electric city side.
向右看，你看到了电城的一面。

746
00:32:43.600 --> 00:32:48.120
This is going to be a good day for Dunder Miffin and Saber.
这将是邓德·米弗林和雪芭美好的一天。

747
00:32:48.880 --> 00:32:49.420
Saber.
雪芭。

748
00:32:51.320 --> 00:32:52.000
It's Saber.
是雪芭。

749
