1611
01:13:45.630 --> 01:13:46.690
The scene is so good.
这场戏太棒了。

1612
01:13:46.890 --> 01:13:48.130
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

1613
01:13:48.370 --> 01:13:49.070
It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

1614
